---
layout: base.njk
title: Services
description: Telehealth psychiatric evaluations, medication management, and care for anxiety, depression, bipolar disorder, ADHD, trauma and PTSD, and child and adolescent mental health in Florida.
permalink: /services/
---
{% from "pic.njk" import pic, banner %}
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Psychiatric care built around you</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ services.intro }}</p>
  </div>
</section>
{{ banner('b-services', 'Mangrove shoreline at dawn on Florida\'s Gulf Coast, with a purple butterfly lifting off a sea grape branch', [800, 1200, 1600]) }}

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <ul class="svc-detail">
      {% for s in services.items %}
      <li>
        {% if s.image %}<div class="svc-img">{{ pic(s.image, "", "(max-width: 860px) 92vw, 560px", [480, 800]) }}</div>{% endif %}
        <h2>{{ s.name }}</h2>
        <p>{{ s.body }}</p>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section steps-band" style="background:var(--lavender)">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0">Who we see</h2>
      <p>Children from age 6, teens, adults and older adults anywhere in Florida. All visits are by secure video, so care fits around school, work and family.</p>
      <h2>How care works</h2>
      <p>Treatment is evidence-based and personal. Alongside medication when it's helpful, Ada draws on approaches such as cognitive behavioral therapy techniques and motivational interviewing, with attention to sleep, stress and daily habits.</p>
      <p>If you'd benefit from ongoing therapy or another kind of specialist, we'll help you find it and coordinate where that helps.</p>
    </div>
    <aside class="aside" style="background:#fff">
      <h2>Ready to start?</h2>
      <p>Book with insurance or as self-pay, or call with any questions.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/book/">Book a visit</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="tel:{{ site.phone | tel }}">Call {{ site.phone }}</a>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
